  "verdict": "void",
  "section": "105",
  "quote": "The only security deposit that a landlord may collect is a rent deposit collected in accordance with section 106.",
  "reason": "A damage deposit held to be returned if the unit is left in good condition falls under the definition of a security deposit in subsection 105(2), and subsection 105(1) prohibits collecting any security deposit other than a rent deposit. Because the clause is inconsistent with section 105, it is void under subsection 4(1)."
}

